builds are on the public repository\n\u003Ca href=\"https://github.com/mantissatech/pgha-cli\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">mantissatech/pgha-cli\u003C/a>.\nThe \u003Ca href=\"https://mantissatech.github.io/pgha-cli/install/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">install page\u003C/a> has the\ncommands for the shell script, Homebrew, apt, yum, Scoop, and Windows.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>From source:\u003C/p>\n\u003Cdiv class=\"code-block\" data-lang=\"bash\">\u003Cpre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">go\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -o\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pgha\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">./pgha\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --help\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\u003C/div>\n\u003Cp>\u003Ccode>make build\u003C/code>, \u003Ccode>make test\u003C/code> and \u003Ccode>make lint\u003C/code> do the same tasks.\n\u003Ccode>make snapshot\u003C/code> builds every platform into \u003Ccode>./dist\u003C/code> and publishes nothing.\u003C/p>\n",[],"Release builds are on the public repository mantissatech/pgha-cli. The install page has the commands for the shell script, Homebrew, apt, yum, Scoop, and Win…",{"slug":9,"title":10},"requirements","Requirements",{"slug":12,"title":13},"quick-start","Quick start"],"uses":{"params":["slug"]}}]}
